{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17744","headline":"和刘员外陪韩仆射野亭公宴 · 杨巨源","name":"和刘员外陪韩仆射野亭公宴","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"好客风流玳瑁簪，重檐高幕晓沈沈。\n绮筵霜重旌旗满，玉帐天清丝管声。\n繁戏徒过鲁儒目，衆欢方集汉郎心。\n寒笳一曲严城暮，云骑连嘶香外林。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杨巨源","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17744.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17744","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}